# Test Variables File for Terraform Tests

Copy this file as `test.tfvars` or `terraform.tftest.tfvars` and update values for your environment.

Usage:
```bash
cd tests/dev
terraform test -var-file=test.tfvars
```

## Required Variables

```hcl
# Azure Tenant ID (UUID format)
tenant_id = "your-tenant-id-here"

# Container App image to deploy (must include registry and tag)
container_app_image = "mcr.microsoft.com/azuredocs/aci-helloworld:latest"

# Static Web App name (must be unique globally)
static_web_app_name = "test-swa-dev"

# Container App name
container_app_name = "test-ca-dev"
```

## Optional Variables

```hcl
# Override default location
# location = "East US"

# Override static web app location
# staticWebAppLocation = "East US 2"

# Override resource group name
# resource_group_name = "my-rg1"

# Override OS type
# os_type = "Linux"

# Override SKU name
# sku_name = "PremiumV2"
```

## Example Complete File

```hcl
tenant_id                = "12345678-1234-1234-1234-123456789012"
container_app_image      = "myregistry.azurecr.io/myapp:latest"
static_web_app_name      = "myapp-swa-dev"
container_app_name       = "myapp-ca-dev"
location                 = "East US"
staticWebAppLocation     = "East US 2"
resource_group_name      = "my-rg1"
os_type                  = "Windows"
sku_name                 = "PremiumV2"
```
